===============================================================================

 PURPOSE:
 ~~~~~~~~
  With Sent_FE you are able to start ByteAndi's AutoSent from a Bulletin.
  This way EVERYBODY has to enter his Private SentBy-Line for use with
  FILE_ID.DIZ.

  When a valid SentBy-Line already exists then you don't get to see any
  output of this Door!


===============================================================================

 REQUIREMENTS:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Ami Express 3.xx


===============================================================================

 INSTALLATION:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  o Copy the EmP_Tools Directory to DOORS:

  o Sent_FE should be started from a Bulletin:

    as BBS:Bull.txt

--[ start: cut here ]-------------------------
~CC_FE_Sent
--[ stop: cut here ]--------------------------

    or with a txtfile (BBS:Bulletins/bull.txt)

--[ start: cut here ]-------------------------
~SS_BBS:Bulletins/bull.txt|~CC_FE_Sent
--[ stop: cut here ]--------------------------


  AE 3.xx:
  ~~~~~~~~
  - Copy Sent_FE.info to BBS:Commands/SYScmd/

    Or add to Sent_FE.info ICON ToolType Info:

      ACCESS=001
      LOCATION=DOORS:EmP_Tools/Sent_FE
      MULTINODE=YES
      PRIORITY=0
      STACK=50000
      TYPE=XIM


===============================================================================

 ERROR MESSAGES:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  o ERROR:  DOORS:FILEID/Sent.DAT Not Found !!!
  |
  `--> JoinCnf.CFG can't be found in DOORS:EmP_Tools !?


