===============================================================================

 NOTE:
 ~~~~~
  o This Program Has been tested on a /X 3.32 Configuration.

  o Sent_FE will startup ByteAndi's AutoSent when:

     - There isn't a Valid SentBy-Line
     - The User never entered a SentBy-Line
     - The UserName in Sent.DAT is different to the one he/she is using now.

    else Sent_FE will stay silent and won't put Any text on screen.


